      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "宿屋の調理場が壊れてしまっていて……\n今はお料理を出すことができないんです。\n直すための資材もなかなか手に入らなくて……\nもしお持ちなら分けてやってください。",
        "official_en": "Sorry, the inn's kitchen has been destroyed, so we\naren't serving food at the moment. If we could only\nget our hands on the materials to fix it... If you have\nany, we'd put them to good use here.",
